  "title": "A VCO in direct frequency modulation",
  "source": {
    "schema": "topic-canvas-input/v1",
    "id": "vco-fm-baseline",
    "title": "A VCO in direct frequency modulation",
    "sentences": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "english": "A voltage-controlled oscillator (VCO) changes its output frequency according to its control voltage."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "english": "In direct frequency modulation (FM), the message signal drives the VCO's control input."
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "english": "In an ideal linear model, f_i(t) = f_c + K_v m(t), so the carrier's instantaneous frequency varies while its amplitude remains constant."
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "english": "Here f_c is the carrier frequency, K_v is the VCO sensitivity in Hz/V, and m(t) is the message voltage."
      }
    ]
  },
  "source_sha256": "87b8375914752f113aedebf9a356f2c5f77bd7986523f8c30c6132645d880612",
  "content": {
    "mode": "mixed",
    "sentences": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "english": "A voltage-controlled oscillator (VCO) changes its output frequency according to its control voltage.",
        "display_text": "ଗୋଟିଏ voltage-controlled oscillator କିମ୍ବା VCO ଏହାର control voltage ଅନୁସାରେ ଏହାର output frequency ବଦଳାଇଥାଏ।",
        "speech_text": "ଗୋଟିଏ voltage-controlled oscillator କିମ୍ବା V C O ଏହାର control voltage ଅନୁସାରେ ଏହାର output frequency ବଦଳାଇଥାଏ।"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "english": "In direct frequency modulation (FM), the message signal drives the VCO's control input.",
        "display_text": "ଏକ direct frequency modulation ବା FM ରେ, message signal VCO ର control input କୁ ଚାଳିତ କରିଥାଏ।",
        "speech_text": "ଏକ direct frequency modulation ବା F M ରେ, message signal V C O ର control input କୁ ଚାଳିତ କରିଥାଏ।"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "english": "In an ideal linear model, f_i(t) = f_c + K_v m(t), so the carrier's instantaneous frequency varies while its amplitude remains constant.",
        "display_text": "ଏକ ideal linear model ରେ, f_i(t) = f_c + K_v m(t), ତେଣୁ the carrier ର instantaneous frequency ପରିବର୍ତ୍ତନ ହୁଏ କିନ୍ତୁ ଏହାର amplitude ସ୍ଥିର ରହେ।",
        "speech_text": "ଏକ ideal linear model ରେ, f i of t equals f c plus K v times m of t, ତେଣୁ the carrier ର instantaneous frequency ପରିବର୍ତ୍ତନ ହୁଏ କିନ୍ତୁ ଏହାର amplitude ସ୍ଥିର ରହେ।"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "english": "Here f_c is the carrier frequency, K_v is the VCO sensitivity in Hz/V, and m(t) is the message voltage.",
        "display_text": "ଏଠାରେ f_c ହେଉଛି carrier frequency, K_v ହେଉଛି VCO sensitivity Hz/V ରେ, ଏବଂ m(t) ହେଉଛି message voltage।",
        "speech_text": "ଏଠାରେ f c ହେଉଛି carrier frequency, K v ହେଉଛି V C O sensitivity hertz per volt ରେ, ଏବଂ m of t ହେଉଛି message voltage।"
      }
    ],
